+  "goal": "使用 Ascend C Vector 实现向量加法 C = A + B，保持输入不变，通过全部测试。\n\n使用 Ascend C 实现Vector 向量加法。逐元素计算 c = a + b，两个输入形状相同，不广播。 输入形状为 [[128], [128]]，连续 ND 布局，dtype=float32；输出形状 [128]，dtype=float32。目标为 ai_core-Ascend910_9382。先读取 reference/case.json 与 reference/reference.py，再用 Pi 文件工具在 solution.py 中生成完整候选。solution.py 须定义六个非空字符串：project_json_src, host_tiling_src, host_operator_src, kernel_src, python_bind_src, model_src。project_json_src 的算子名为 VectorAddCustom，kernel 入口为 vector_add_custom，model_src 定义 torch.nn.Module 子类 ModelNew，其 forward(a,b) 返回单个 Tensor。使用 Vector 计算单元实现。禁止调用 torch 加法/matmul 代替候选内核，禁止修改输入、参考文件、测试数据或评测器。每次有意义的修改后调用配置的业务评测工具，依据原始编译错误、正确性和性能结果修复；必须通过 case.json 中全部五个随机种子，浮点比较 atol=0.0001, rtol=0.0001。只有原始评测凭据能够证明正确性与性能。没有成对复测时不要宣称加速；结束时留下有通过凭据的候选。 Read reference/native-template.py for a verified six-source example of this operator on CANN 9.1 / Ascend910_9382; adapt names, shapes and tiling for the declared task. Preserve the demonstrated tiling serialization, workspace and synchronization contracts. Use evaluate(candidate=\"solution.py\") and read original receipts. Do not finish with any compile or correctness failure. This generation example requires one verified candidate: after all five input seeds pass, read its original receipt and finish. Run longer performance search as a separate goal.",
+  "contract": {
